This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-egf-swupdate layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

  URI: https://github.com/sbabic/meta-swupdate.git
  branch: scarthgap

Patches
=======

Please submit any patches against the meta-egf-swupdate layer to the maintainer:

Maintainer: Mauro Salvini <mauro.salvini@elettronicagf.it>

Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-egf-swupdate layer to your build
 II. Misc

I. Adding the meta-egf-swupdate layer to your build
=================================================

Run 'bitbake-layers add-layer meta-egf-swupdate' and then add
'include conf/distro/include/swupdate.inc' in your distro or
machine file

II. Misc
========

Since TMPDIR for swupdate is moved in /mnt/ota (or whatever defined in SWU_TMPDIR variable
in conf/distro/include/swupdate.inc), to invoke from CLI utilities like swupdate-progress
and swupdate-client you need to add a heading "TMPDIR=/mnt/ota" to the command, e.g.
    TMPDIR=/mnt/ota swupdate-client ...